      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_brother_01",
      "hash64": "B30F4CC7D6156887",
      "text": "괘, 괜찮아...![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_sister_02",
      "hash64": "CBFF4ED8D0C2751E",
      "text": "카지!\\n너 대체 무슨 속셈이야?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_brother_02",
      "hash64": "B30F4DC7D6156A3A",
      "text": "도깨비님! 많이 무섭겠지만,\\n저... 열심히 했어요...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_brother_03",
      "hash64": "B30F4EC7D6156BED",
      "text": "그러니까...\\n믿고 따라와 주시겠어요...?[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_people_01",
      "hash64": "04AB79A5880E5D6E",
      "text": "저게 도깨비...\\n오거폰...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_people_02",
      "hash64": "04AB78A5880E5BBB",
      "text": "진짜로 있었구나!?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_ogre_02",
      "hash64": "721FB2C1311E11C7",
      "text": "가... 가오.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_select_01",
      "hash64": "0A5307DC793D299B",
      "text": "괜찮아",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_select_02",
      "hash64": "0A5308DC793D2B4E",
      "text": "카지를 믿자",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_caretaker_01",
      "hash64": "9A314B5A446CFDA1",
      "text": "도깨비산의 도깨비...[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_caretaker_02",
      "hash64": "9A31485A446CF888",
      "text": "아니, 오거폰 님![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_caretaker_03",
      "hash64": "9A31495A446CFA3B",
      "text": "오랜 세월, 우리 북신에서는\\n당신을 악한 존재라고 전해 왔습니다.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_caretaker_04",
      "hash64": "9A314E5A446D02BA",
      "text": "진심으로 사과드리겠습니다.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_ogre_03",
      "hash64": "721FB1C1311E1014",
      "text": "포니...!?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_sister_03",
      "hash64": "CBFF4FD8D0C276D1",
      "text": "뭐가 어떻게 된 거예요!?\\n갑자기 무슨 바람이 불어서!?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_gfather_01",
      "hash64": "7CE90C884A5AF468",
      "text": "이 애가... 카지가 말이다.\\n온 마을을 돌아다니면서\\r\\n사람들에게 진짜 역사를 알려 줬단다.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_gfather_02",
      "hash64": "7CE90F884A5AF981",
      "text": "반감을 사기만 할 뿐이니\\n그만두라고 말렸다만...[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_people_03",
      "hash64": "04AB77A5880E5A08",
      "text": "도깨비님~\\n그동안 미안했어~!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_people_04",
      "hash64": "04AB7EA5880E65ED",
      "text": "오거폰, 귀여워~!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_gfather_03",
      "hash64": "7CE90E884A5AF7CE",
      "text": "아무래도 내 생각이\\n잘못됐던 모양이더구나.[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_sister_04",
      "hash64": "CBFF50D8D0C27884",
      "text": "올~ 카지, 제법인데!\\n말주변도 없으면서![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_brother_04",
      "hash64": "B30F47C7D6156008",
      "text": "이제, 얼굴을 감추지 않아도...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_brother_05",
      "hash64": "B30F48C7D61561BB",
      "text": "언제든지 마을에\\n놀러 오셔도 돼요.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_ogre_04",
      "hash64": "721FB0C1311E0E61",
      "text": "...포니오!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_caretaker_05",
      "hash64": "9A314F5A446D046D",
      "text": "센터에서 보관 중이던\\n3개의 가면도 원래는\\r\\n오거폰 님의 것이라죠...?[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_caretaker_06",
      "hash64": "9A314C5A446CFF54",
      "text": "세벗들에게서 되찾으셨다면\\n계속 갖고 계세요.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_sister_06",
      "hash64": "CBFF52D8D0C27BEA",
      "text": "오해도 풀리고\\n가면도 되찾아서 정말 다행이야![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_sister_07",
      "hash64": "CBFF53D8D0C27D9D",
      "text": "그야말로 해피 엔딩이네![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_sister_08",
      "hash64": "CBFF44D8D0C26420",
      "text": "마지막으로 우리 같이\\n오거폰을 집까지 바래다주자![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc01_0430_caretaker_07",
      "hash64": "9A314D5A446D0107",
      "text": "오거폰 님에게는 정말\\n입이 열 개라도 할 말이 없습니다.\\c\\n앞으로는 올바른 역사를\\n전하도록 하겠습니다.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
